TITLE Mix DIC and Ca solutions 1:1, heat 20 to 200 C with calcite equilibration
SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 50
SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 40 60 80 100 120 140 160 180 200
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -totals Ca C(4)
    -equilibrium_phases Calcite
END
